{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本男星龜梨和也剛結束高雄的巡迴見面會返回日本，29日透過官方粉絲俱樂部網站宣布，將與前TBS主播、現為演員的田中美奈實結婚，並同步公開田中已懷有兩人第一個孩子的喜訊。</p><p>龜梨和也親筆發表聲明表示：「這次，我將與田中美奈實結婚。同時，我們也迎來了新的生命。」他也再次向一路支持自己的粉絲表達感謝，並表示未來仍會持續投入演藝工作。</p><figure><img alt=\"龜梨和也親筆發表聲明，與田中美奈實結婚，2人也迎來新生命。（IG@k_kamenashi_23）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260629/1148273097942503424891453.jpeg/Q8MgFAFaZrAhuVMHjqcfoc-fsLPpKSm8PxjE1T8YxNU\"/><figcaption>龜梨和也親筆發表聲明，與田中美奈實結婚，2人也迎來新生命。（IG@k_kamenashi_23）</figcaption></figure><p>更多龜梨和也、田中美奈實照片：</p><figure><img alt=\"龜梨和也（IG@k_kamenashi_23）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963848200010076160438650.jpeg/bbfJbTWkFS3PDlBZnKz3xwJipUI3C10krG7Xfaxu130\"/><figcaption>龜梨和也（IG@k_kamenashi_23）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"龜梨和也（IG@k_kamenashi_23）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963848210320199680198627.jpeg/sSFiiDwZsER9xOPVR5l-KXo2FplxGedN2vTJbdr0yW0\"/><figcaption>龜梨和也（IG@k_kamenashi_23）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"龜梨和也（IG@k_kamenashi_23）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963848209498116096140562.jpeg/BPwd6moBh8nsgoJBTrYxTc_Bb_TkK6hsZn-012Z_tNc\"/><figcaption>龜梨和也（IG@k_kamenashi_23）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"田中美奈實（IG@tanaka_minami_fan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210121/428911566319915008486359.jpeg/zREYZk9aKJEMgu9JtuKyn0aby99K8Bszg81hnoPNYZ4\"/><figcaption>田中美奈實（IG@tanaka_minami_fan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"田中美奈實（IG@tanaka_minami_fan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260417/1121870036777046016380564.jpeg/zNOZG_Fst0fIx-MViM6_nxFK_T7R1yQKn680Rp-vNEY\"/><figcaption>田中美奈實（IG@tanaka_minami_fan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"田中美奈實（IG@tanaka_minami_fan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210121/428911568329117696407186.jpeg/SII4JRFDs6RyDYramk23LE8z5m57sP2e0BkKidAZCok\"/><figcaption>田中美奈實（IG@tanaka_minami_fan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"龜梨和也（IG@k_kamenashi_23）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963848206947848192914653.jpeg/4WGKGMZX1hyYJP8TI-nEpMluVQdkqbLmDShaqw0oWqs\"/><figcaption>龜梨和也（IG@k_kamenashi_23）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"龜梨和也（IG@k_kamenashi_23）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963848203932012544719508.jpeg/w6RRZUQSjqVgXHjgxKVTckxbfsdhUAJQtILqq7SC6qs\"/><figcaption>龜梨和也（IG@k_kamenashi_23）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"龜梨和也（IG@k_kamenashi_23）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963848200005881856058412.jpeg/l9H-bUQJMxhIi7s_d0ql8QlUuvhXqLE_VkanxFZGp8Q\"/><figcaption>龜梨和也（IG@k_kamenashi_23）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"龜梨和也（IG@k_kamenashi_23）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963848200005881856167203.jpeg/zpoqipLxmIuhNVpa-Xbm_fy2VaZxnB85X0z-Yl9M_mI\"/><figcaption>龜梨和也（IG@k_kamenashi_23）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"龜梨和也（IG@k_kamenashi_23）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963848200232374272306957.jpeg/8fwVWldtJIC6JUfxwmp7rwfU3Q5zKNJ3uNFD9LjRQ_Q\"/><figcaption>龜梨和也（IG@k_kamenashi_23）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"田中美奈實（IG@tanaka_minami_fan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260417/1121870043970670592681520.jpeg/1lydOrfh8aPC9Auss-OZ1AUl56M7OBEZHrMQ0B6zENA\"/><figcaption>田中美奈實（IG@tanaka_minami_fan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"田中美奈實（IG@tanaka_minami_fan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260417/1121870046298640384268735.jpeg/QGyP49kJb_zOMgtkCrcdiv_DeZ-rPzoUH87AIR_OwCE\"/><figcaption>田中美奈實（IG@tanaka_minami_fan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"田中美奈實（IG@tanaka_minami_fan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260417/1121870041571397632169528.jpeg/95gxxYtpyyF0-JBwP9I6i6jXrocO18qdCd7HrQnex60\"/><figcaption>田中美奈實（IG@tanaka_minami_fan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"田中美奈實（IG@tanaka_minami_fan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210121/428911560686571520964307.jpeg/yzHFkrKEBwIQSHWQIx6usjrnrkp9YlLwrArnzawK580\"/><figcaption>田中美奈實（IG@tanaka_minami_fan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"田中美奈實（IG@tanaka_minami_fan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210121/428911564453318656913065.jpeg/ZdgmQJP7SmtmrK-PPRV0ZjFo3Ze2Ws-2ntxY0Z7cWNE\"/><figcaption>田中美奈實（IG@tanaka_minami_fan）</figcaption></figure><p>龜梨和也和田中美奈實約於2023年因時尚雜誌「MAQUIA」的企劃對談結識，之後又在2024年朝日電視台日劇《Destiny》中合作演出。</p><p>兩人的戀情曾於2024年元旦被部分媒體爆料，雖未直接點名，但外界很快聯想到兩人，社群平台也掀起「認真交往」等關鍵字熱議。</p><p>由於兩人名字的組合，還被網友封為「令和版《Touch》」，獲得不少祝福。當時龜梨和也所屬的SMILE-UP.（前傑尼斯事務所）僅回應：</p><p>田中美奈實則於2014年9月底離開TBS，近年除了主持、綜藝節目外，也積極投入戲劇演出，曾在NHK日劇《關於惡女》中首度擔綱主演，演藝事業發展多元。</p><p>【延伸閱讀】新木優子、中島裕翔「螢幕情侶」成正果！超高顏值組合官宣已結婚（點圖放大瀏覽▼▼▼）</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀】新木優子、中島裕翔「螢幕情侶」成正果！超高顏值組合官宣已結婚（《明天也有好吃的飯》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260413/1120414052053815296506297.jpeg/b8UVEjhboRqwD-LpwfgKj-GTq7W5rjzFDm6ZIg5umSI\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀】新木優子、中島裕翔「螢幕情侶」成正果！超高顏值組合官宣已結婚（《明天也有好吃的飯》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"STARTO ENTERTAINMENT 於4月11日通過官網等渠道正式宣佈：演員中島裕翔（32歲）與女演員新木優子（32歲）已登記結婚。（《明天也有好吃的飯》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260413/1120414044868579328798142.jpeg/n0s5ZzIJVC8meQ7RMyYbD7bp47KpqGMxkwQPo5MED6M\"/><figcaption>STARTO ENTERTAINMENT 於4月11日通過官網等渠道正式宣佈：演員中島裕翔（32歲）與女演員新木優子（32歲）已登記結婚。（《明天也有好吃的飯》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"新木優子、中島裕翔演情侶。（《明天也有好吃的飯》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260413/1120414047297212416763901.jpeg/2hwxHy4D5k4zQgPzjOaO1y6dIdHnPetRLK9sSSyvbEk\"/><figcaption>新木優子、中島裕翔演情侶。（《明天也有好吃的飯》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"新木優子、中島裕翔演情侶。（《明天也有好吃的飯》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260413/1120414049528713216623841.jpeg/UJcGHddLWxa1sb-7WuOGqiLDxgyVihvDPLilWDy4pVg\"/><figcaption>新木優子、中島裕翔演情侶。（《明天也有好吃的飯》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"新木優子（IG＠yuuuuukko_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260413/1120410106035703808215893.jpeg/TAMDMW9ni0hWBp_M5MWxi7qTFZdRFySGyrYaqcq2Gqk\"/><figcaption>新木優子（IG＠yuuuuukko_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"新木優子（IG＠yuuuuukko_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260413/1120410099081285632710453.jpeg/EHtU7dU4-jCHMmp5UAUTMMbUWevFZrIsdEMF8HRDBfA\"/><figcaption>新木優子（IG＠yuuuuukko_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"新木優子（IG＠yuuuuukko_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260413/1120410441718173696491562.jpeg/mXJK706Vj34B3auYEiotP9w_LNZuOmidkXNvKJFzbyg\"/><figcaption>新木優子（IG＠yuuuuukko_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"新木優子（IG＠yuuuuukko_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260413/1120410444109058048183649.jpeg/bpjXtJYxs8k6TkQTRrjSyKuiZ5-ftRrFLrFR9S6xUfU\"/><figcaption>新木優子（IG＠yuuuuukko_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"新木優子（IG＠yuuuuukko_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260413/1120410102562689024856092.jpeg/YMkwJL26-5c17EJLvR_04T1noeFSCbrV-SpmFPkqZhQ\"/><figcaption>新木優子（IG＠yuuuuukko_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中島裕翔（IG@iam_yuto_nakajima）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260413/1120408625970810880263195.jpeg/46dMPRKTj6j8q_hyL_AuHt5s7NGHbpMuiryUjIq8lIw\"/><figcaption>中島裕翔（IG@iam_yuto_nakajima）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中島裕翔（IG@iam_yuto_nakajima）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260413/1120408628810485760697534.jpeg/q0W6ydveaF_bqmDDedUc1BGxP9qQk2O1ap0SjmqdEo4\"/><figcaption>中島裕翔（IG@iam_yuto_nakajima）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中島裕翔（IG@iam_yuto_nakajima）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260413/1120408626650288128482305.jpeg/nEoaRjCaw8DTqmoMVD8oKg1ACD3jzUewmB7EKZgexCk\"/><figcaption>中島裕翔（IG@iam_yuto_nakajima）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中島裕翔（IG@iam_yuto_nakajima）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260413/1120408624532033536983057.jpeg/ySRt0QHqQ0G6T-scAzh0WHnOWPCtwknQu2Tlkrtk5ZI\"/><figcaption>中島裕翔（IG@iam_yuto_nakajima）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中島裕翔（IG@iam_yuto_nakajima）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260413/1120408621944016896258431.jpeg/vwB26yX4xvS5aE6E2Y6OAbvp_uDBtv0T632zE-t9sxM\"/><figcaption>中島裕翔（IG@iam_yuto_nakajima）</figcaption></figure><p>撐不住！龜梨和也確定出走 KAT-TUN 成軍25年宣布解散</p><p>龜梨和也傳將退出KAT-TUN、閃婚女主播？業界人士推測他這天會宣布重大決定</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-29T07:59:35.734105+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1480,"images":31,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}